# PLACEHOLDER test scenes for the battle triggers (0705), played by the
# debug Quick Battle. Not story: the real Chapter 1 lines come from 0707.

@scene test_turn_3
> Turn 3. A rogue has slipped into the fort to the east.
@end

@scene test_fort
@left test_lord neutral
test_lord: The old fort. Someone was here not long ago.
@end

@scene test_engage
@right test_rogue angry
test_rogue: You picked the wrong fort to storm.
@end

@scene test_rogue_half
@right test_rogue angry
test_rogue: That all you've got? I've had worse from my own crew.
@end

@scene test_talk
@left  test_lord neutral
@right test_rogue surprised
test_lord: Put the axe down. You aren't one of them.
test_rogue[happy]: ...Fine. I was never paid anyway. Find me when this is over.
@end

@scene test_rogue_falls
@right test_rogue sad
test_rogue: Should have taken the other job...
@end

@scene test_lord_falls
@left test_lord sad
test_lord: I can't... go on...
@end

@scene test_knight_dies
@left test_knight sad
test_knight: Tell them I held the line.
@end

@scene test_knight_retreats
@left test_knight angry
test_knight: I'm hurt. Falling back!
@end
